# Third-party reference images downloaded during research are personal reference only
# and must never be committed (this repo is public). Link them from
# research/oregon/refs/SOURCES.md instead. Ulo's own screenshots go in refs/ulo/ (tracked via LFS).
research/oregon/refs/web/
# While the repo is public, Ulo's own screenshots stay local too (they show Ubisoft's game); share them in the
# chat instead. Remove these two lines once the repo is private (research/oregon/refs/ulo/README.md).
research/oregon/refs/ulo/*
!research/oregon/refs/ulo/README.md

# Oregon extraction scratch (tools/mapgen/extract): floor rasters, overlays and intermediate JSON. The images
